{
  "description": "Live probes on 2026-11-10: GET and DELETE of absent pipe/key/reverse-endpoint UUIDs under a verified disposable service return HTTP 404 with 'NOT_FOUND: <UUID>'. Lists under a deleted service return the same service-UUID message; an inaccessible organization returns bare 'NOT_FOUND'. Type only the UUID-bearing absence responses, leaving inaccessible organizations fatal. A child GET/DELETE may also report its missing parent.",
